.TH QJAVA2JAR 1 "September 2026" "Qore JNI"
.SH NAME
qjava2jar \- build a JAR from Java sources with Qore support
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B qjava2jar
[options] output.jar source-directory
.SH DESCRIPTION
Compiles a directory of Java sources using Qore dynamic bindings and writes a JAR archive.
.SH OPTIONS
Use --root=DIRECTORY to select the Java package root, -d DIRECTORY for temporary class output, and -cp PATH for additional dependencies.
.PP
Run the command with --help for the full option list.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR qore (1)
